            <h2 id="good-to-know-heading" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-4xl">Good to know before entering.</h2>
            <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-ink/70">The prizes provide a useful, bounded starting point. Assessment, diagnosis and troubleshooting do not guarantee repair, recovery or complete resolution.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <li class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6">
                <h3 class="font-extrabold">Local service area</h3>
