<section class="py-16 md:py-24" aria-labelledby="terms-heading">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6">
        <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent-ink">Prize conditions</p>
        <h2 id="terms-heading" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-4xl">The short version.</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 rounded-3xl border border-line bg-surface p-7 leading-relaxed text-ink/75 md:p-10">
            <p>Each prize is redeemable for one listed standard Naked Tech service in its stated tier, delivered at one residential address in Ivanhoe or Eaglemont. Booking is required and subject to reasonable availability and a brief service-choice check. Local call-out and the standard published scope recorded at issue are included.</p>
            <p class="mt-4">The voucher is transferable before booking, is not redeemable for cash and cannot be combined with another voucher. There is no additional payment solely because the published price later increases and no residual credit if it decreases. Work outside the selected scope requires a separate optional quote. Each issued voucher will show its unique code, issue date, expiry date and full conditions. Consumer rights are not excluded.</p>
            <p class="mt-4">Naked Tech may help the holder choose another listed service in the same tier if the first choice is unsuitable. If a listed service is discontinued, an agreed substantially equivalent service or another service in the same tier may be offered.</p>
            <div class="mt-7 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap">
                <a href="/service-terms/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-bold text-accent-ink underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Read the customer service terms</a>
                <span class="hidden text-line sm:inline" aria-hidden="true">|</span>
                <a href="/assets/ivanhoe-primary-school-fundraiser-prizes.pdf" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-bold text-accent-ink underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Download the fundraiser PDF</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
